TCF-27 SplitTryte Color Palette Bank v1.0

Standardized 81-color palette based on base-3 RGB components scaled by intensity banks.

[LAYOUT]
splitTryte = [11|BANK_L|VAL_L2|VAL_L1|VAL_L0|BANK_R|VAL_R2|VAL_R1|VAL_R0]
standard_marker = 11

[DESIGN_RULES]
1. Every splitTryte stores two colors (foreground and background, or dual pixel colors).
2. BANK:+ is Bright/Vibrant colors (scaled to 100% saturation).
3. BANK:- is Dark/Shadow colors (scaled to 50% max brightness).
4. BANK:0 is Normal/Medium colors (scaled to 75% max brightness).
5. Within each bank, value indexes 00 to 26 are structured as R*9 + G*3 + B in trinary.
6. Full color space is 3 banks * 27 colors = 81 distinct palette colors.

[BANK_LANES]
+ = UPPER_ALPHA          = 10
- = LOWER_ALPHA          = 00
0 = NETIV_NUMERIC_SYMBOL = 01

[VAL_LANES]
00 = --- = 00|00|00
01 = --0 = 00|00|01
02 = --+ = 00|00|10
03 = -0- = 00|01|00
04 = -00 = 00|01|01
05 = -0+ = 00|01|10
06 = -+- = 00|10|00
07 = -+0 = 00|10|01
08 = -++ = 00|10|10
09 = 0-- = 01|00|00
10 = 0-0 = 01|00|01
11 = 0-+ = 01|00|10
12 = 00- = 01|01|00
13 = 000 = 01|01|01
14 = 00+ = 01|01|10
15 = 0+- = 01|10|00
16 = 0+0 = 01|10|01
17 = 0++ = 01|10|10
18 = +-- = 10|00|00
19 = +-0 = 10|00|01
20 = +-+ = 10|00|10
21 = +0- = 10|01|00
22 = +00 = 10|01|01
23 = +0+ = 10|01|10
24 = ++- = 10|10|00
25 = ++0 = 10|10|01
26 = +++ = 10|10|10

